			<m_name type="p">
				<CGIText type="e">
					<m_str type="a">The algorithms of protection mechanisms are implemented in the E2E Library. The%0D
callers of the E2E Library are responsible for the correct usage of the library. E2E will support Profiles 1, 2, 4, 5, 6. For CRC calculation, the E2E library will call the CRC routines.%0D
</m_str>
					<m_style type="a">Arial; 10 0 0 0 1 </m_style>
					<m_color type="p">
						<IColor type="e">
							<m_fgColor type="a">0</m_fgColor>
